      "notes": [
        "Property 1 is exposed as property1. The canonical Strip set contains two variants even though one documentation table says one configuration.",
        "The four thumbnails are native images with a 2px gap and 150.5px image-row height at the original 608px strip height.",
        "selectedIndex is a runtime selection control, not a Strip Figma variant. It starts at the selected first thumbnail seen in both source examples.",
        "Opaque image-fill stacks are represented by their final visible image paint, matching exported previews. Arrow keys and Home/End select and focus thumbnails."
