      "overview": "The atomic history-thumbnail unit in the Creator sidebar. Each HistoryRail tile represents one past creation — multi-image results show a 2×2 grid of thumbnails (22×22 each inside 46×46), while single-image results show one full thumbnail. The selected state carries a blue border. Paired with a \"New creation\" button above and a \"See all\" link below.",
