        },
        {
          "name": "property2",
          "kind": "select",
          "values": [
            "Default",
            "Selected"
          ],
          "default": "Default"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        "This molecule is one HistoryRail tile; the full history panel composes multiple tiles.",
        "Property 1 is exposed as property1 and Property 2 as property2. All eight canonical combinations are supported.",
        "The actual selected stroke is #515151 at 1.2527998686px, not the stale specification table text claiming 2px blue.",
        "The default multi-image tile is 54px, has a 46px inner grid, 2px row gap and 2.142857px column gap; fractional source geometry is retained.",
        "Loading uses the source #f8f4f1 placeholder; Video uses the exact exported play-icon vector."
      ],
